<title>LUXEMBOURG: Santer says no delay to EMU.</title>
<headline>Santer says no delay to EMU.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Commission President Jacques Santer said on Sunday there would be no delay to the European Union's plans for economic and monetary union (EMU).</p>
<p>&quot;No delay,&quot; Santer said when asked about the fate of EMU as he entered an EU finance ministers meeting.</p>
</text>
